D3D12 command list gaps. Queries: occlusion and binary occlusion through Metal visibility results in the
heap, timestamps sampled by a blit pass into a counter sample buffer and resolved on the GPU (after their
command buffer completed), statistics resolve to zeros. ExecuteBundle replays recorded bundle calls; buffer
to buffer CopyTextureRegion, WriteBufferImmediate, whole-region ResolveSubresourceRegion; DiscardResource.

